   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "The outermost operation is a product of \\( 5^{x} \\) and \\( e^{\\cos(x^{2})} \\), so the product rule comes first: \\( f'(x) = \\left(5^{x}\\right)'\\,e^{\\cos(x^{2})} + 5^{x}\\left(e^{\\cos(x^{2})}\\right)' \\).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Multiply",
            [
               "Power",
               5,
               "x"
            ],
            [
               "Exp",
               [
                  "Cos",
                  [
                     "Power",
